{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don\u2019t be the chew toy. Don\u2019t be the chew toy. Don\u2019t be the chew toy. Don\u2019t be the chew toy...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your gang. Loot some houses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, sure. Except these houses are in the strangest neighborhood in the world, filled with bizarre mutations of science\u2026 and the Good Boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Good Boy?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op horror comedy, where you and your friends attempt to gather piles of epic loot without making noise (and summoning the mutated pets that defend the town). Make it back to your hideout with your ill gotten gains, split the cash, upgrade your burglar hideout, and grow your infamy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, we can\u2019t guarantee there will be any survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670740?t=1761839246","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670740/a0a7d803876858e20526cf97b7fca78af2dc840f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761839246","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670740/14e3faab69f1077ddd795318cbe2157a6175b86f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761839246","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670740/14e3faab69f1077ddd795318cbe2157a6175b86f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761839246","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Good Boy is a comedy horror, and some elements may be scary for younger players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don\u2019t be the chew toy. Don\u2019t be the chew toy. Don\u2019t be the chew toy. Don\u2019t be the chew toy...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your gang. Loot some houses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, sure. Except these houses are in the strangest neighborhood in the world, filled with bizarre mutations of science\u2026 and the Good Boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Good Boy?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op horror comedy, where you and your friends attempt to gather piles of epic loot without making noise (and summoning the mutated pets that defend the town). Make it back to your hideout with your ill gotten gains, split the cash, upgrade your burglar hideout, and grow your infamy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, we can\u2019t guarantee there will be any survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Terrible Posture Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670740/b91ed41eb4824bc5bd2ef50ab16515e33e0fc4f9/header.jpg?t=1761839246","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Good Boy Copyright 2025, Terrible Posture Games, Inc. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nGood Boy uses the Unreal\u24c7 Engine. Unreal\u24c7 is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States and elsewhere.<br />\r\nUnreal\u24c7 Engine, Copyright 1998-2025, Epic Games, Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/